@host = http://localhost:5000
@conta = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@token = <cole o access_token retornado por /auth/login>
@refresh = <cole o refresh_token retornado por /auth/login>

### Login por API (password grant via BFF; para navegadores use GET /bff/login no browser: Authorization Code + PKCE)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "cliente.a", "senha": "dev-only-a" }

### Renovar o token
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### Quem sou eu / quais contas posso acessar
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar lancamento (roteado para Lancamentos.API)
POST {{host}}/api/contas/{{conta}}/lancamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tipo": "Credito", "valor": 100.00 }

### Debito acima do saldo => 422 (saldo insuficiente)
POST {{host}}/api/contas/{{conta}}/lancamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-sem-saldo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tipo": "Debito", "valor": 999999999 }

### Mesma Idempotency-Key com outro corpo => 422
POST {{host}}/api/contas/{{conta}}/lancamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tipo": "Credito", "valor": 555.00 }

### Saldo agora (roteado para Consolidado.API)
GET {{host}}/api/contas/{{conta}}/saldo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consolidado do dia (UTC)
GET {{host}}/api/contas/{{conta}}/saldo-diario/2026-10-19
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout (revoga a sessao no Keycloak)
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }
